From 921fa66a1da9ad7732156fd716ad610cc705d58e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PeterChamp <peter@maszatai.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 14:13:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] feat: always-visible frog option

- New settings toggle 'Always show the frog' (default ON, persisted)
- When ON, night and sunset scene animations fall back to the day frog
  animation of the same scene/condition, since Google's night frogs often
  sleep or hide off-screen
- Localized in all 9 languages
